sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Auth Page
    participant NextAuth as NextAuth Credentials
    participant DB as Database
    participant OAuth as Google OAuth

    User->>UI: Enter email and password
    UI->>NextAuth: signIn("credentials")
    NextAuth->>DB: Load user by email
    DB-->>NextAuth: User record

    alt Invalid credentials
        NextAuth-->>UI: Reject sign-in
        UI-->>User: Show login error
    else Valid credentials
        NextAuth-->>UI: Create session
        UI-->>User: Redirect to dashboard
    end

    User->>UI: Click Google sign-in
    UI->>OAuth: signIn("google")
    OAuth-->>UI: Return to callback URL
